# Staged by fisher-5sg.9 on 2026-11-25. See README.md for derivation.
# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# (go, info, bestmove and quit), and the owner's 2026-11-25 D17 answers
# on fisher-5sg.10, recorded as fisher-r6y D49–D52 and D56.
# fisher-5sg, "The go-parameters transcript", specifies the full successor.
# D41 supplies the searched info spelling. D28 and fisher-5sg decision 10
# specify the default and cumulative nodes. python-chess 1.11.2 and
# published perft (expectations/perft.epd) supply the fixed-depth counts.
# Scores follow fisher-2aj rules 1–7. The README beside this session shows
# the working. The last four searches retain the active session's setup.
> position startpos
> go depth 1
# UCI go depth and fisher-5sg.5: one finished depth with 20 nodes.
< info depth 1 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 20 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
# UCI bestmove and D5.
< bestmove {legal}

> go nodes 20
# UCI go nodes and fisher-5sg.5: the twentieth node finishes depth 1.
< info depth 1 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 20 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
# UCI bestmove and D5.
< bestmove {legal}

> go movetime 50
# UCI go movetime and fisher-5sg.7: D22/D31 give 40 ms after the margin.
# D41 spells each finished-depth report. UCI bestmove and D5 give the move.
<* info depth {depth} multipv 1 score {score} nodes {nodes} nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< bestmove {legal}

> go wtime 60000
# D49 and D56 allow any finished depths in order. D41 spells info.
# UCI bestmove requires one legal move. See README.md for the time for the move.
<* info depth {depth} multipv 1 score {score} nodes {nodes} nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< bestmove {legal}

> go btime 60000
# D51/D28 and fisher-5sg decision 10. See the README for the per-ply counts.
< info depth 1 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 20 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 2 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 440 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 3 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 9762 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 4 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 216365 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
# UCI bestmove and D5. D51 supplies no limit from the clocks here.
< bestmove {legal}
> go winc 1000
# D51/D28 and fisher-5sg decision 10. See the README for the per-ply counts.
< info depth 1 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 20 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 2 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 440 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 3 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 9762 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 4 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 216365 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
# UCI bestmove and D5. D51 supplies no limit from the clocks here.
< bestmove {legal}
> go binc 1000
