< info depth 1 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 20 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 2 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 440 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 3 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 9762 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 4 multipv 1 score cp 0 nodes 216365 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
# UCI bestmove and D5. D51 supplies no limit from the clocks here.
< bestmove {legal}
> go movestogo 40
