# UCI bestmove and D5. The owner defers pondering in fisher-2ha.
< bestmove {legal}
# UCI position after an unknown prefix replaces a position with one legal move.
> position fen 7k/8/5K1Q/8/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1
> go
# D28 and fisher-5sg decision 10. See the README for the per-ply counts.
# Rules 2 and 3 score the horizon by material, so depths before the mate show material.
< info depth 1 multipv 1 score cp -900 nodes 1 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 2 multipv 1 score cp -900 nodes 23 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 3 multipv 1 score mate -1 nodes 75 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
< info depth 4 multipv 1 score mate -1 nodes 857 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
# UCI bestmove and D5. Enumeration gives h8g8 as the sole legal move.
< bestmove h8g8
